r</span>: Can you tell me what you had to do?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. I learned a lot in the onboarding workshops the IT Department ran.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Did you have any problems with what they showed you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not really. Once I reviewed everything, I felt comfortable. I didn't run into any problems.", "id": 2, "time": "5400", "image": "engenn5le17ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How's your work area?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I bought a plant for decoration.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's it, just a plant?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I was busy working on the surveys for my blog. Could you help me?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Of course, it would be my pleasure.", "id": 3, "time": "20500", "image": "engenn5le17ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Would you mind asking your friends to answer a short questionnaire, too?  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I can do that!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Super! The more responses, the better!", "id": 4, "time": "32500", "image": "engenn5le17ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, do you have a regular schedule?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: As a freelancer, it depends on the day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Are you able to chat again this weekend?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I would love to! I'll talk to you later.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: OK, bye.", "id": 5, "time": "39250", "image": "engenn5le17ob10re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob10re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}